---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Connect" description="Get in touch with Carlos Ali about Quote-to-Cash consulting and CPQ implementations.">
  <div class="container">
    <section class="about-header">
      <h1>Connect</h1>
    </section>

    <section class="about-content">
      <p>The best way to reach me is on LinkedIn. I'm active there and always open to conversations about Quote-to-Cash strategy, CPQ implementations, and revenue operations.</p>

      <div class="credentials" style="margin-top: 2rem;">
        <div class="credential-item">
          <h4>LinkedIn</h4>
          <p><a href="https://linkedin.com/in/carlosali" target="_blank" rel="noopener">linkedin.com/in/carlosali</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="credential-item">
          <h4>Email</h4>
          <p><a href="mailto:carlos@carlosali.com">carlos@carlosali.com</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 style="margin-top: 3rem;">What I Can Help With</h2>

      <p>If you're exploring any of the following, I'd enjoy the conversation:</p>

      <ul style="padding-left: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--slate);">Evaluating Salesforce CPQ vs. Revenue Cloud vs. other platforms</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--slate);">Scoping a Quote-to-Cash implementation or migration</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--slate);">Diagnosing why your current CPQ isn't delivering value</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--slate);">Building a business case for Q2C investment</li>
      </ul>

      <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--gray-500); font-style: italic;">I respond to most LinkedIn messages within a day or two.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
